        "text_FzEBEOnUZRwEqgx0": "<p><strong>How often can I use Lio?</strong></p>",
        "text_1sqZXtnZfcAyJ7fH": "<p>You can use Lio as often as you like. It’s completely natural and free of nicotine, smoke, or vapor, so there’s no harm in frequent use.</p>",
